verdict('134','SUPPLIED-SOURCE-DIFF:I:p134','Three Module capitals and two punctuation spaces','All five normalization changes withdrawn','Local source-comparison verdict; no supplied page-record ID exists. The scan and three source regions were personally compared during the recorded p134 review.','See CHECK_RECORD.md p134 and evidence/I_p134_opening.png, evidence/I_p134_adjunction.png, evidence/I_p134_proof-ending.png, evidence/I_p134_footnote.png.')
